mapping "N978A.1" source="N978A" target="6738008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source N978A SNOMED CT 6738008 = female infertility due to immunological causes (Swedish national
        5-char extension of N97.8). SNOMED CT mirror has no specific immunological-infertility concept
        (closest hits are abnormal immunological findings in serum, which are findings not the
        disorder). Best defensible standard target is SNOMED CT 201909 (Female infertility, concept_code
        6738008), the standard concept that the WHO-equivalent N97 group maps to via Athena crosswalk.
        Broader: target fully subsumes the source (every immunological-infertility case is female
        infertility). Low confidence : Swedish extension code, no exact or one-level-broader SNOMED CT
        target, and the specific aetiology is lost.
        """
}
